'''Pyon Pyon for Two''' (２人でぴょんぴょん, ''Futari de Pyonpyon'', '''Hopping with Two''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

==Combo==
